{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_st03","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_st03","title":"一問之答","storyCode":"WR-ST-3","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_st03.txt","sourceHash":"80d6bef1181b9ccd52450e6b2bc4d0aeb14acd1a4a75f29b83af203af8afac38","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......秋天了。\n山楂該很甜吧。孩子們最喜歡吃山楂了。\n......\n......又是一天。\n我還剩下多久壽命呢？\n一閉眼，就會想起很多過去的事情......\n......一夜無眠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......夕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你好像一點都不吃驚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"活到這把歲數，吃驚的情況，就少多啦......咳咳，不過和你說這個，還是小巫見大巫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們......有多少年沒見過了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"記不得了，幾十年吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你可是夕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然還記得我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道你不是在我的畫裡，度過了你這一生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你很自信嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夕，你救過我，我在你的畫裡生活過那麼長的時間......我分得清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是我和你打的賭，賭我有朝一日一眼就能勘破你的畫，你的天地，還有你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過那日分別之後，你再也沒來見過我呀......我以為我再也沒有機會......和你說上話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......能這麼和我說話的人，本就不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這麼長時間，我經常回憶起那段日子。那座涼亭......遠離了天災、饑荒、難民的，普通的涼亭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像做夢一樣......咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以為，你會是個不錯的畫家。你卻一生沒有執筆。豈不是枉費了我一番教誨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畫家，畫家，畫之大家，見過你之後，誰還能自稱畫家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"難得還是有一些的。都是些......奇人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那我可讓你失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說不定......你才是讓我意外的那個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"時隔多年再見......好像沒什麼話說。我人老珠黃，走完一生，你呢，卻還是那個你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你有什麼想說的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有......我......很安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你救了我，你給了我活下去的機會......現在在我彌留之際，你也來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很欣慰，夕，看看你......還是這副模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼睛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很老啦，夕，病魔折磨了我許多年......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在我倒想問問你......你看著認識的那些人一個個死去，你會感到寂寞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"胡說什麼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你會怎麼想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......偶爾會惋惜。偶爾也會感慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你啊......總算肯說實話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......還記得我和你說過的，我那被天災毀盡的家鄉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在回想起來，已經太遠太遠啦......那裡是我回憶的影子，那裡已經不在我身後，他們在遙遠的前方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我從未自己執筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為如果我這輩子要畫，我只會畫，咳咳，我的家鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你明明什麼都記不得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，就算去回想，除了“婆山鎮”這個名字，我也什麼都不記得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那裡沒什麼好回憶，但我卻總是夢到它。夢到很多個的......故鄉。你說，人這一輩子，到底想回去哪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......夕啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你能幫我，畫出那婆山鎮嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只記得，家邊上，是座當鋪。當鋪裡的帳房先生，穿得都很漂亮，文質彬彬。小時候，我想過，我也想當個帳房先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"村子沒有那些古怪的移動地塊，農田和瓦舍肆意生長，建在哪算哪，像油菜花一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是不小心走遠些了，就會看見遠處的山......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那座山......我常常夢見在那裡迷路，那裡有可怕的怪物......天災雲，從山頭那邊浮現......這是我記得的最清楚的風景了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不用我多說，你也能感覺得到吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然，一點不落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多想讓歲月停在年輕的時候，我們在山上住，我學著你畫，偶爾幫你研墨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夕啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你見過多少奇人異事，看過多少滄海桑田......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你幫我瞧瞧看，你說我......咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說我這輩子......幸福嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"我算是明白，你為什麼要把我帶到這裡來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......都是些什麼人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"打麻將嗎？三缺一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你......趕緊滾出去，我是不會去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你明明興致勃勃地看了一晚上電影，這會又裝涼薄無情了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"喜歡電影也沒事，我這裡可有好些收藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......你那都是什麼，粗製濫造的剪貼封面，毫無意義的長命名，看了就倒胃口，快拿開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼能這麼說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......我看過不少行動檔案，這個博士是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你偷偷拿的？沒被可露希爾發現吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你說那個年輕的魔族？她沒管我，我直接過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......憑什麼......她是不是針對我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"監察司和羅德島是什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"那是另一件事，沒關係，別緊張。驚蟄也是貶謫之身，而且現在基本不來羅德島了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼在乎她？那邊是不是有官差找過你麻煩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，不在乎這小小的監察司，倒是在乎這雷法出處......她那師父，還有總盯著我們的那些老傢伙，沒一個省事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你說我畫地為牢？他可是直接燒穿畫卷，焚盡眼前江山，非要來教訓我一通。我又不是你，也不曉得礙著誰了，就要挨一頓罵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"我煩他煩得要死，又拿他沒有辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯嚯，還發生過這種事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......你還沒告訴我，博士和凱爾希是什麼人？你待在這裡，和這兩人有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，他們現在在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"......好啊。我都告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣你就知道......我為什麼喜歡這個地方了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2014_nian","aliases":["年"]},{"speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","aliases":["夕"]}]}
